UME SATOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country> </address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NISHINO KOUJI</name><address><country>JP</country> </address> </addressbook> </applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OHMI TADAHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TOKYO ELECTRON LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJIKIN INCORPORATED</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HIROSE, JUN</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAGATSUME, SATOSHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NISHINO, KOUJI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHMI, TADAHIRO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOKYO ELECTRON LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HIROSE JUN</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KAGATSUME SATOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NISHINO KOUJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OHMI TADAHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HIROSE, JUN</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAGATSUME, SATOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NISHINO, KOUJI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHMI, TADAHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A versatile flow rate controller comprises an orifice (8) exchangeable depending on the required opening for a different fluid and a different flow rate range, a control valve (2) on the upstream side, a pressure detector (6) between the control valve (2) and the orifice (8), an arithmetic circuit (14) for calculating a flow rate as Qc=KP1 (K is a constant) from an upstream pressure P1 detected by the detector (6); an output circuit (16) for providing a flow-setting signal Qe, a converter circuit (18) for producing a flow rate signal Qf (Qf=kQc) by multiplying the calculated flow rate signal Qc by a factor k to change the full-scale flow rate, and a control circuit (20) for supplying a driver section (4) of the control valve (2) with a control signal Qy corresponding to the difference between the Qf and Qe.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un organe de commande de débit polyvalent, qui comporte un orifice (8) pouvant être changé en fonction de l'ouverture requise pour un fluide différent et une plage de débits différente, une soupape (2) de commande située en amont, un détecteur (6) de pression situé entre la soupape (2) de commande et l'orifice (8), un circuit (14) arithmétique pour calculer un débit tel que Qc=KP1 (K étant une constante) à partir d'une pression en amont P1 détectée par le détecteur (6) ; un circuit (16) de sortie servant à fournir un signal de réglage de débit Qe, un circuit (18) de convertisseur produisant un signal de débit Qf (Qf=kQc) en multipliant le signal de débit calculé Qc par un facteur k en vue de modifier le débit à plein rendement, et un circuit (20) de commande servant à fournir à une section (4) de commande de la soupape (4) de commande un signal de commande Qy correspondant à la différence entre Qf et Qe.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>